  "sources": "[\"https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/where-to-eat-in-paris/food-events/articles/331496-history-decree-baguette-tradition\",\"https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/where-to-eat-in-paris/food-events/articles/330833-history-baguette-parisian-tradition-french-national-symbol\",\"https://www.euronews.com/2022/11/30/unesco-lists-the-french-baguette-as-an-intangible-cultural-heritage-of-humanity\",\"https://www.lalibre.be/international/europe/2022/11/30/populaire-mais-en-peril-la-baguette-inscrite-au-patrimoine-immateriel-de-lhumanite-CI2VSXBU65BNNPYPPAKEUKE3ME/\",\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baguette\",\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/August_Zang\",\"https://cdn.paris.fr/presse/2024/04/18/4598f4f32bf1ca6309938184e159d047.pdf\",\"https://www.paris.fr\"]"
